<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens vs dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens vs dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened against the dollar and the pound on Wednesday on tightened dollar supply, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a commercial mean rate of 611.8200 against the dollar from 610.0380 on Tuesday. Against the pound the shilling traded at mean rate 1013.6961 from Tuesday's 1001.5314.</p>
</text>
